# Bridge conformance fixtures — Task 1.5b per ADR-003.
#
# The .msgpack files are binary byte oracles authored by the Rust
# `gen-fixtures` binary (`<name>.msgpack`) and by the TS conformance
# test under `BRIDGE_GEN_FROM_TS=1` (`<name>.from-ts.msgpack`). They
# must never be touched by git's text-normalisation pipeline — a
# stray autocrlf or eol conversion would silently corrupt the byte
# oracle and flip the conformance suite to red without any
# meaningful diff in the source tree.
*.msgpack binary
*.from-ts.msgpack binary

# The .json source-of-truth files are plain text and must stay LF
# on every host so a Windows checkout does not produce diff noise
# during regeneration.
*.json text eol=lf
